# 电商页面、静态资源与验证服务；在广告/隐私拦截之后匹配

# eBay 香港站、主站跳转及静态资源
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ebay.com.hk
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ebay.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ebaystatic.com

# 页面中出现的 PerfDrive 验证端点，仅匹配这个主机
DOMAIN,cas.avalon.perfdrive.com

# Ozon 帮助中心；不扩大到其他 Ozon 业务
DOMAIN,global-help.ozon.com

# eSIM.GG public coverage, account entry, and rates API.
# https://esim.gg/rates/world-map
# Keep the three service hosts on the same route. Public pages and rates were verified directly.
DOMAIN,esim.gg
DOMAIN,account.esim.gg
DOMAIN,api.esim.gg

# Toss static assets include the flag icons used by the eSIM.GG storefront.
# https://tossmini-docs.toss.im/tds-react-native/components/asset/
# The referenced PNG and a 4 MiB PDF range were verified directly.
DOMAIN,static.toss.im
